{{Term/Store|Blue Flame|Blue Flames|Series, BotW|plural}},{{Exp Game|BotW}} also known as {{Term/Store|Blue Fire|Blue Fires|OoT, OoT3D}},{{Exp Game|OoT}}<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= |book= E |publisher= |page= 117 {{Exp Game|OoT}}}}</ref> are recurring [[Item]]s and [[Object]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.

==Location and Uses==
==={{OoT|-}}===
{{Descriptions OoT}}
Blue Fire can be found in the [[Ice Cavern]] and [[Ganon's Castle]] in {{OoT}}. It can also be bought at the [[Medicine Shop]] for 300 [[Rupee]]s. In {{MQ}}, it can also be found in the [[Gerudo's Training Ground]].

Blue Fire is used to melt [[Red Ice]]. [[Link]] must first scoop it from a pedestal by using a [[Bottle]] or buying it from the Medicine Shop. Blue Fire is required to progress through the Ice Cavern and obtain the [[Iron Boots]] and a [[Piece of Heart]]. It is also needed to get the [[Zora Tunic]] by melting the Red Ice in which [[King Zora]] is encased. Alternatively, Link can melt the Red Ice blocking the entrance to the [[Zora Shop]] in order to buy the Tunic.

Blue Fire also appears atop Skull-shaped [[Torch]]es from the [[Bottom of the Well]], though it cannot be collected from them.

==={{BotW|-}}===
Blue Flame is a type of [[Fire]] that never burns out while in a [[Torch]] in {{BotW}}. Certain Torches can only be lit with Blue Flames, such as inside the [[Divine Beast Vah Rudania]], within [[Ancient Shrine]]s, and the [[Ancient Furnace]]s outside of the [[Akkala Ancient Tech Lab]] and the [[Hateno Ancient Tech Lab]]. [[Link]] must bring Blue Flame to both Ancient Tech Labs from a nearby Blue Fire furnace in order to activate certain features of the Tech Lab. Link must use a wooden [[Weapon]], such as a [[Torch]] or a [[Tree Branch]], to transport Blue Flame. At the Hateno Ancient Tech Lab, this will allow Link to upgrade his [[Sheikah Slate]]. At the Akkala Ancient Tech Lab, this will allow Link to exchange [[Ancient Material]]s for many types of [[Ancient Soldier Gear]] and equipment. If Blue Flames are used to set flammable objects on fire, they will behave the same way as normal Fire.

The Blue Flame blows up [[Remote Bomb]]s and shatters [[Cryonis]] blocks on contact.

==Trivia==
*Blue Fire can be used to destroy bombable walls in {{OoT}}.<ref>{{Cite Web|quote= |author= VerySydney|published= December 19, 2016|retrieved= January 2, 2017|url= https://www.twitch.tv/verysydney/v/108456047|title= How to get the market skulltula with no explosives|site= Twitch|type= Video}}</ref>
*All of the [[Hylian]] Hateno villagers have unique dialogue if [[Link]] speaks to them while holding a torch lit with the Blue Flame, save [[Pruce]]. The children will also follow Link indefinitely, even out of [[Hateno Village]], until he gets too far away from them or puts the torch out.

